'''Steppe sand''' was a block in [[MinecraftEdu]]. It was a purely decorative soil block, with no functionality.

== Obtaining ==
Steppe sand was not available in the creative inventory. It was only obtainable through being given in the [[teacher menu]] or by being distributed by console command, such as with a [[command block]].

== Usage ==
It can be used as a building material.

